      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2FP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 398058856,
      "version": 1628,
      "versionNonce": 1491417934,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1780489687667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PREPARATION FOR COGNITO WEB PAGE LOAD IN STEP 1\n\n- generate random state value (e.g. 4dc45bad)\n- generate random code verifier value (e.g. 7Oez9cpr)\n- generate code_challenge by hashing the code verifier using SHA-256 (e.g. SHA256(7Oez9cpr) → Raz07laq)\n- store code verifier and state in browser storage \n  - This is because the React application is about to be jettisoned in favour of the aws login authentication web page\n  - Once the aws login webpage redirects back to our callback page we will be able to read these values back from storage\n ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PREPARATION FOR COGNITO WEB PAGE LOAD IN STEP 1\n\n- generate random state value (e.g. 4dc45bad)\n- generate random code verifier value (e.g. 7Oez9cpr)\n- generate code_challenge by hashing the code verifier using SHA-256 (e.g. SHA256(7Oez9cpr) → Raz07laq)\n- store code verifier and state in browser storage \n  - This is because the React application is about to be jettisoned in favour of the aws login authentication web page\n  - Once the aws login webpage redirects back to our callback page we will be able to read these values back from storage\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
